  "sections": [
    {
      "key": "quickFacts",
      "source": "glaser",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/07-carp-like-fishes-1-loaches/hillstream_loach_week_at_aquarium_glaser_part_2_beaufortia_leveretti_en/",
      "html": "<p>This is by far the most often offered hillstream loach. The whole habitus is very similar to the Sewellia species. The coloration is formed by pretty black spots on a golden background.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "distribution",
      "source": "glaser",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/07-carp-like-fishes-1-loaches/hillstream_loach_week_at_aquarium_glaser_part_2_beaufortia_leveretti_en/",
      "html": "<p>It originates from China and Vietnam, but is currently imported from China only.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "waterConditions",
      "source": "glaser",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/07-carp-like-fishes-1-loaches/hillstream_loach_week_at_aquarium_glaser_part_2_beaufortia_leveretti_en/",
      "html": "<p>B. leveretti is not a tropical fish at all, but comes from moderate climate zones. It is impossible to keep it in the long term at water temperatures above 24°C. The ideal range is 12°C in winter and 21°C in summer. Avoid abrupt jumps in temperature!</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "equipment",
      "source": "glaser",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/07-carp-like-fishes-1-loaches/hillstream_loach_week_at_aquarium_glaser_part_2_beaufortia_leveretti_en/",
      "html": "<p>B. leveretti is an ideal inhabitant of unheated aquaria and helps you save energy costs.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "behaviour",
      "source": "glaser",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/07-carp-like-fishes-1-loaches/hillstream_loach_week_at_aquarium_glaser_part_2_beaufortia_leveretti_en/",
      "html": "<p>A perfect tankmate for B. leveretti is the White cloud mountain minnow, Tanichthys albonubes. A school of about 15-20 specimens of that fish in the water column and 10-12 Beaufortia form a very nice picture.</p>"
    }
  ],
